{"id":"torrey:miracles-through-evil-agents","source":"torrey","name":"Miracles Through Evil Agents","slug":"miracles-through-evil-agents","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Performed through the power of the devil — 2Th 2:9; Re 16:14.","refs":[["2Thess",2,9,2,9],["Rev",16,14,16,14]]},{"text":"In support of false religions. — De 13:1-2.","refs":[["Deut",13,1,13,2]]},{"text":"By false christs. — Mt 24:24.","refs":[["Matt",24,24,24,24]]},{"text":"By false prophets. — Mt 24:24; Re 19:20.","refs":[["Matt",24,24,24,24],["Rev",19,20,19,20]]},{"text":"A mark of the Apostasy — 2Th 2:3,9; Re 13:13.","refs":[["2Thess",2,3,2,3],["2Thess",2,9,2,9],["Rev",13,13,13,13]]},{"text":"Not to be regarded — De 13:3.","refs":[["Deut",13,3,13,3]]},{"text":"Deceive the ungodly — 2Th 2:10-12; Re 13:14; 19:20.","refs":[["2Thess",2,10,2,12],["Rev",13,14,13,14],["Rev",19,20,19,20]]},{"text":"Magicians of Egypt. — Ex 7:11,22; 8:7.","refs":[["Exod",7,11,7,11],["Exod",7,22,7,22],["Exod",8,7,8,7]]},{"text":"Witch of Endor. — 1Sa 28:7-14.","refs":[["1Sam",28,7,28,14]]},{"text":"Simon Magus. — Ac 8:9-11.","refs":[["Acts",8,9,8,11]]}],"refCount":18}
